hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2897","###\n Narrated to us Al-Fadl bin Ya'qub Al-Jazari, who narrated to us Abd al-A'la, on the authority of Muhammad, on the authority of Abdullah bin Abi Najih, on the authority of Mujahid, on the authority of Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: \The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) offered a camel belonging to Abu Jahl as part of his sacrificial offering (Hady) during the year of Al-Hudaybiyah"," and upon its head was a silver ornament."""
